    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10">

                <pb facs="0027" n="9" sameAs="frus:frus1946v11/pg9"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710 Consultation 4/4–146: Circular telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Diplomatic Representatives in the
                            American Republics Except Argentina and Haiti</hi><anchor n="26"
                        xml:id="d10-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-04-01T00:00:00-05:00">April 1,
                        1946—midnight.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please see FonMin at once and submit memo
                    embodying text quoted in immediately following circular telegram<anchor n="27"
                        xml:id="d10-f2"/> and stating that if majority of Govts agree with our
                    position we propose to make a public statement thereof on or about Apr 8. Memo
                    should add that we hope Govt to which you are accredited will authorize us to
                    express its concurrence with our position or will make a public statement along
                    similar lines on same date.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d10-f1" n="26" type="source" xml:id="d10-f1-content">
                <p>This circular was sent to Buenos Aires and to Port-au-Prince “as secret
                    information only”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d10-f2" n="27" xml:id="d10-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
